## Summary

Add a read-only CLI wrapper for the PR Action Bridge (python -m tools.pr_action_bridge plus scripts/pr-action-bridge) that reads a PR Steward artifact directory and writes ACTION_PLAN.json and REPAIR_PACKET.md by reusing compile_action_plan(); document the runnable Steward-to-Bridge pipeline.

## Scope

Allowlist-bound; see commit.allowlist. Out of scope: Do not perform any GitHub mutation. Do not import tools.pr_merge or dopemux_pr_merge_specialist. Do not recompute readiness; PR Steward owns readiness.

## Validation

See commit.verify; embedded audit + proof bundle required.

